    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/f183b164aafe65ce922c427b79d909e7.avif?t=1753126600\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Highlights</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic art and setting:</strong> Visual style and soundtrack that transport players to the represented era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that impact the storyline:</strong> Allow players to make decisions that alter the course of the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free exploration:</strong> Let them move freely and discover locations without restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery and discovery:</strong> Small hidden details in the environment can influence the final outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternative ending:</strong> Depending on the player's choices, reaching the tower may lead to different resolutions\u2014facing the Gatto King, uncovering a greater secret, or perhaps escaping the simulation cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging gameplay:</strong> Fluid movement, small puzzles to unlock hidden passages, and a constant sense of discovery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a fractured world, where ruins drift in the void and the sky twists in defiance of logic. Absolute silence blankets this lifeless place\u2014a simulation lost between realities. Nothing here obeys the rules of the known world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No explanations, no context. Only a call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distance, a towering structure rises, solitary against the horizon. An invisible force whispers to your subconscious: <strong>go to the great tower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/469ad8d429c5e37154395b2782355b81.poster.avif?t=1753126600\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/469ad8d429c5e37154395b2782355b81.webm?t=1753126600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/469ad8d429c5e37154395b2782355b81.mp4?t=1753126600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The path is long and filled with mysteries.</strong> Echoes of the past haunt the landscapes\u2014shadows of forgotten stories that reveal themselves as you move forward. Secrets lie hidden in the fractures of reality, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the heart of the tower,\u00a0<strong>he waits.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/b32a9ce1bea01af6edf17bff581e74f9.avif?t=1753126600\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gatto Rei.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But are you truly ready to face him? Or is there something even greater lurking behind this simulation?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/452eaa358ec418be1dd874a464f06b3b.avif?t=1753126600\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
