trong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/469ad8d429c5e37154395b2782355b81.poster.avif?t=1753126600\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/469ad8d429c5e37154395b2782355b81.webm?t=1753126600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/469ad8d429c5e37154395b2782355b81.mp4?t=1753126600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The path is long and filled with mysteries.</strong> Echoes of the past haunt the landscapes\u2014shadows of forgotten stories that reveal themselves as you move forward. Secrets lie hidden in the fractures of reality, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the heart of the tower,\u00a0<strong>he waits.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/b32a9ce1bea01af6edf17bff581e74f9.avif?t=1753126600\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gatto Rei.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But are you truly ready to face him? Or is there something even greater lurking behind this simulation?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676830/extras/452eaa358ec418be1dd874a464f06b3b.avif?t=1753126600\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
